# Street: a slow walk under the lamps. The main theme, half-remembered.
# Section A plays the Lamplight opening over B minor chords, so it feels familiar but darker.
# Section B lets the real tune through in D major, then A2 turns it upward and walks home.
tempo 76
meter 4/4
grid 8
swing 0.14
key B minor
form Walk A B A2

voice lead  inst=pulse duty=0.33 tone=2900 att=0.014 vol=0.36 vib=13 echo=0.24 echotime=0.75 rel=0.2 role=melody pan=-0.1 shape=0.1 human=0.004
voice oca   inst=flute vol=0.34 vib=13 pan=0.08 rev=0.36 role=melody shape=0.12 human=0.004
voice bell  inst=bell vol=0.13 pan=0.3 rev=0.42 role=melody
voice bass  inst=bass vol=0.70 gate=0.82 role=bass human=0.005
voice keys  inst=epiano auto=comp pattern=--x---x- lo=57 hi=74 size=3 vol=0.17 pan=0.22 rev=0.32 gate=0.8
voice pad   inst=pad auto=chords lo=50 hi=74 vol=0.13 tone=1100 rev=0.45 att=0.5
voice kit   inst=drums vol=0.15 human=0.003

master room=2.3 wet=0.48 loud=-19

section Walk
